flowchart TB
 D["Meet and Gemini<br/>Original outputs in organization Drive"] -.-> J["Source job<br/>Readiness and exact Drive version"]
 J -->|Verified transcript| R["Roundtable core and publication client<br/>Transcript when supplied<br/>Separate notes and actions"]
 R -.->|Publish exact content| W["Website service<br/>Publication API and member policy"]
 W -.->|Read back content and audience| R
 W -.-> P["Member website<br/>Transcript and notes<br/>Active membership required"]
 R -.->|Verified publication links| T["Paperclip task and Buzz thread"]
 R --> A["Native meeting follow-up<br/>Protected source reference"]
 J -->|Summary-only source| A
 A --> T
 R -.-> K["Trusted knowledge admission<br/>Reviewed facts and adopted decisions<br/>Source version and access scope"]
 K -.-> DB[("Reusable DAO knowledge")]
 class J,R,A,K core
 class W planned
 class DB store

 classDef core fill:#e7f1ee,stroke:#157d80,color:#132e38,stroke-width:2px
 classDef planned fill:#fffaf0,stroke:#b1853e,color:#132e38,stroke-dasharray:6 4
 classDef reviewed fill:#f5f0ff,stroke:#8064a2,color:#132e38
 classDef store fill:#edf2f7,stroke:#61788b,color:#132e38
